# ${project_name}

FastAPI service generated by `nexus dev create fastapi` (NexusOS Engineering Edition).

## Run

```bash
python3 -m venv .venv
. .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements-dev.txt
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

Open http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs for the interactive API documentation.

## Test

```bash
pytest
```
